.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt AETERNUM 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm aeternum
.Nd Aeternum Security OS overview
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Aeternum Security OS is a live and installable operating system based on
.Fx 15.1
(amd64), for security work.
It provides the XFCE desktop, the
.Xr pf 4
firewall enabled by default, and a set of security tools installed as
packages.
The image boots in UEFI mode.
.Pp
The default user is
.Li admin
with the password
.Li admin ;
the same password is set for
.Li root .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /etc/pf.conf
Firewall rules.
.It Pa /etc/sysctl.conf
Kernel and network hardening settings.
.It Pa /boot/loader.conf.local
Boot-time tunables, read after
.Pa /boot/loader.conf .
.It Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum
Skeleton files, boot animation.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr aeternum-installer 8 ,
.Xr aeternum_live 8 ,
.Xr aeternum-splash 1 ,
.Xr aeternum-set-wallpaper 1 ,
.Xr pf.conf 5 ,
.Xr sysctl.conf 5 ,
.Xr loader.conf 5
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Zef Lleshaj
